{"start": "2026-11-03T08:00:29.000Z", "prompt": "for augumentation logs, I have additional information, use it and change the assignment accordingly . Also change the video script if  needed\n\n\nThe logs should ideally capture the following details:\n\n1. AI Tool & Model: Tool and model used (GitHub Copilot, Claude, Cursor, etc.).\n2. Agent Details: Agent type (built-in/custom/sub-agent) and execution mode (Ask/Plan/Agent/Edit).\n3. Prompt & Interactions: Actual queries/prompts submitted to the agent, including follow-up interactions.\n4. Skills & Sub-agents: Skills invoked, custom instructions followed, and any sub-agents utilized.\n5. Tools & Integrations: MCP servers, external tools, or other capabilities accessed.\n6. AI Actions & Outputs: Tasks performed, code generated/modified, tests created, and other deliverables.\n7. Human Intervention: Manual changes, decisions, corrections, and validation performed.\n8. Execution Evidence: Timestamps, affected files, test results, and relevant session/commit references.\n9. Outcome: Whether the interaction was successful, partially completed, or required rework.\n\n\n\nThe primary objective is to establish traceability across the AI-assisted development lifecycle, allowing us to understand how effectively AI was leveraged, which capabilities were utilized, and how the participant validated and refined the AI-generated output.\nIdeally, these logs should be generated automatically wherever supported by the tool, rather than relying entirely on manual documentation. A structured JSON/JSONL log with a readable summary would be preferred.\nThe focus should be on quality of AI utilization, transparency, and evidence of human oversight, rather than simply the number of prompts or agents used.\n \nBelow is one such format you can refer, you can add more details if you think it makes sense:\n\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"20261019T063542Z-agent-requirement-transcription\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T06:35:42Z\",\n  \"stage\": \"setup\",\n  \"agent\": \"agent\",\n  \"agent_name\": \"<agent_name>\",\n  \"agent_type\": \"<built-in | custom | sub-agent>\",\n  \"ai_tool\": \"<ai_tool_name>\",\n  \"model\": \"<model_name>\",\n  \"mode\": \"<ask | plan | agent | edit>\",\n  \"related_ids\": [],\n  \"parent_task\": null,\n  \"context\": \"Assignment for AI in SDLC\",\n  \"request\": \"Analyse Assignment requirement\",\n  \"skills_used\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"<skill_name>\",\n      \"type\": \"<built-in | custom>\",\n      \"purpose\": \"<skill_purpose>\",\n      \"invocation\": \"<automatic | explicit>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"subagents_used\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"<subagent_name>\",\n      \"type\": \"<built-in | custom>\",\n      \"task\": \"<delegated_task>\",\n      \"status\": \"<completed | failed | partial>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"mcp_tools_used\": [\n    {\n      \"server\": \"<mcp_server_name>\",\n      \"tool\": \"<mcp_tool_name>\",\n      \"purpose\": \"<purpose>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tools_used\": [\n    \"<tool_name>\"\n  ],\n  \"suggestion\": \"<Any suggestions>\",\n  \"human_decision\": null,\n  \"action_verification\": \"<action verification>\",\n  \"limitation\": null,\n  \"status\": \"applied\",\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"requirement/complete-requirement.md\"\n  ]\n}", "permission_mode": "auto", "app": "claude-desktop", "cli_version": "2.1.309", "end": "2026-11-03T08:08:29.676Z", "models": ["claude-opus-5-5"], "tool_counts": {"Bash": 18, "Write": 5, "Edit": 5, "Read": 2, "mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan": 1, "Grep": 1}, "files_written": ["<repo>\\submission\\06-video\\video-script.md", "<repo>\\submission\\07-ai-log\\ai-augmentation-log.jsonl", "<repo>\\submission\\07-ai-log\\build_log.py", "<repo>\\submission\\07-ai-log\\extract_session_log.py", "<repo>\\submission\\README.md", "<repo>\\submission\\ai-augmentation-log.md", "C:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-<user>-AppData-Roaming-Claude-scratch-workspaces-9944124c-bd57-4793-839a-36cc53e34dc4-cf41b654-f847-4832-9